@startuml
actor "用户" as User

boundary "编辑器界面" as EditorUI
boundary "导出界面" as ExportUI

control "文献重构控制器" as CitationRebuildController
control "导出控制器" as ExportController

entity "文档实体  " as DocumentEntity
entity "引文实体" as CitationEntity
entity "AFD 模型实体" as AFDModelEntity
entity "输出文件实体" as OutputFileEntity

User -> EditorUI : 编辑 Markdown / 插入 [@key]
EditorUI -> CitationRebuildController : 引文变更通知(docId)

CitationRebuildController -> DocumentEntity : 加载文档(docId)
CitationRebuildController -> CitationEntity : 从缓存加载元数据()
CitationRebuildController -> CitationEntity : 按 GB/T 7714 重建索引()
CitationRebuildController -> DocumentEntity : 更新引文编号()
CitationRebuildController -> DocumentEntity : 更新参考文献列表()

User -> ExportUI : 点击导出 Word/PDF
ExportUI -> ExportController : 执行导出(docId, format)

ExportController -> DocumentEntity : 加载文档(docId)
ExportController -> CitationEntity : 校验参考文献著录完整性()

alt 完整性通过
  ExportController -> AFDModelEntity : 构建 AFD JSON(document)
  ExportController -> OutputFileEntity : 生成(format, afdModel)
  ExportController -> OutputFileEntity : 保存到磁盘(path)
  ExportController -> ExportUI : 显示导出成功(path)
else 完整性失败
  ExportController -> ExportUI : 显示错误(missingFields)
end
@enduml